    <briefdescription>
<para>Helper class for constructing bundles of MachineInstrs. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_m_i_bundle_builder" kindref="compound">MIBundleBuilder</ref> can create a bundle from scratch by inserting new MachineInstrs one at a time, or it can create a bundle from a sequence of existing MachineInstrs in a basic block. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
